# Booking flow for CRM

Step 1: POST /customer
  Fill in customer details:
  {
    "first_name": "Jane",
    "last_name": "Doe",
    "email": "jane@example.com",
    "phone": "+123456789"
  }
  ➔ Returns: "customer_id": 14

Step 2: POST /booking
  Fill in booking details using that customer_id:
  {
    "customer_id": 14,
    "booking_status": "confirmed",
    "total_price": 250.00
  }
  ➔ Returns: "booking_id": 10

Step 3 (Optional): POST /room-booking (or camp, boat, etc.)
  Fill in service details using that booking_id:
  {
    "booking_id": 10,
    "check_in_date": "2026-10-01",
    "check_out_date": "2026-10-05",
    "number_of_guests": 2
  }
